Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyNightRoad" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Limited visibility due to heavy fog reducing reaction time" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Occlusion risk caused by dense fog significantly reducing driver visibility and object detection range.
Severity Score: 0.75